(text
"ARCHITECTURE\n\nATtiny1616. PB2 PWM drives the boost.\nCounts stay on the MCU. Enable is firmware,\nnot a pin. TTL is a test point.\nPower enters on STEMMA QT J4 and J5.\nNo Pi header. No hardware OVP divider."
(at 25.4 218.44 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "6f9e1e19-b0f4-40cf-a8a1-37d7f9946f7d")
)
(text
"PIN MAP\n\nPA0 UPDI. PA1 UART TX, USART0 alternate.\nPA2 collector. PA6 sense. PB2 HV_PWM.\nPB1 SDA. PB0 SCL. PC0 A0. PC1 A1.\nPA3 PA4 PA5 PA7 PB3 PB4 PB5 PC2 PC3\nare no-connect. Default TX is PB2, so TX is remapped.\nTWI alternate is PA1/PA2 and is not used."
(at 25.4 246.38 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "d40e11ca-c3f3-4a7f-9e4b-896a1d0b150e")
)
(text
"BOOST\n\nQ3 TN2404K-T1-GE3, 240 V, SOT-23.\nPins 1 gate, 2 source, 3 drain. Gate is 3.3 V.\nL1 YNR6045-102M, 1 mH, 4.5 ohm.\nC1-C8 10 nF C0G 630 V.\nD1-D8 BAV21W. Footprint pad 1 is the cathode.\nRegulated window about 390-420 V.\nSwitch node about 106 V there. 20% is a fault."
(at 165.1 218.44 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "1c306972-af55-42f4-97e4-8dcf4710c469")
)
(text
"SENSE AND TUBE\n\nR1-R4 33 MOhm 1% plus R5 412 kOhm 0.1%.\nPA6, VDD reference. About 1.04 V per count\nat the tube when VDD is 3.3 V.\nR11 R13 R15 R17 10 MOhm bleed HV to ground.\nR19 and R20 2.49 MOhm in series to the anode.\nD10 cathode clamps Q1 base. Clips are DNP.\nCTC-5, STS-5, and SBM-20 share this bias.\nAbout 400 V. Discharge before handling."
(at 165.1 254 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "5d4a262b-1be8-4f16-ae6e-b33e6fe7f720")
)
(text
"STEMMA QT\n\nJ4 and J5, pin 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL.\nJP2 and JP3 open: address 0x2F.\nA bridge pulls that address bit low.\nR26 and R27 are the only pull-ups."
(at 320.04 218.44 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "f72090d1-f87f-446f-9a06-965301e02d1b")
)
